### DEMO 4: r50-shrinker-selftest accepts an empty suite (suffix glob, not a case count)
K=[SHRINK_SELFTEST: cases=0 failed=0]
NOHARM r50-shrinker-selftest [SHRINK_SELFTEST: cases=0 failed=0] ok
-- contrast: real tool at REV
K2=[SHRINK_SELFTEST: cases=14 failed=0]
-- and a tool that prints nothing (crash) is caught:
K3=[]
NOHARM r50-shrinker-selftest [] RED
